{"id":"7b747fe0cf59fd4b","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-element-distinctness-components.md","title":"Order Chambers of Element Distinctness","display":"thm-element-distinctness-components — Order Chambers of Element Distinctness","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-element-distinctness-components","aliases":["28-thm-element-distinctness-components"],"display":"thm-element-distinctness-components — Order Chambers of Element Distinctness","depends_on":[],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Theorem 16.20 and proof","source_printed_pages":"328–329","source_pdf_pages":"354–355","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"verification_status":"proved-in-note","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-element-distinctness-components"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-element-distinctness-components</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-element-distinctness-components — Order Chambers of Element Distinctness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Theorem 16.20 and proof"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"328–329"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"354–355"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge1\">\\(n\\ge1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_n=\\{x\\in\\mathbb R^n:\\forall i\\ne j\\ x_i\\ne x_j\\}\">\\(W_n=\\{x\\in\\mathbb R^n:\\forall i\\ne j\\ x_i\\ne x_j\\}\\)</span>，采用欧氏拓扑；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_n\">\\(S_n\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]\">\\([n]\\)</span> 上排列集。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\">\\(A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\|\\cdot\\|_2\">\\(\\|\\cdot\\|_2\\)</span> 为欧氏范数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Path}(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{Path}(A)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PathConn}(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{PathConn}(A)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PC}(W_n)\">\\(\\operatorname{PC}(W_n)\\)</span> 由下式内建，路径取值于对应子集。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Path}(A)\\coloneqq\\{\\gamma:[0,1]\\to A:\\forall t\\in[0,1]\\;\\forall\\epsilon&gt;0\\;\\exists\\delta&gt;0\\;\\forall s\\in[0,1]\\;(|s-t|&lt;\\delta\\Rightarrow\\|\\gamma(s)-\\gamma(t)\\|_2&lt;\\epsilon)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Path}(A)\\coloneqq\\{\\gamma:[0,1]\\to A:\\forall t\\in[0,1]\\;\\forall\\epsilon&gt;0\\;\\exists\\delta&gt;0\\;\\forall s\\in[0,1]\\;(|s-t|&lt;\\delta\\Rightarrow\\|\\gamma(s)-\\gamma(t)\\|_2&lt;\\epsilon)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PathConn}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall x,y\\in A\\;\\exists\\gamma\\in\\operatorname{Path}(A)\\;(\\gamma(0)=x\\land\\gamma(1)=y).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PathConn}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall x,y\\in A\\;\\exists\\gamma\\in\\operatorname{Path}(A)\\;(\\gamma(0)=x\\land\\gamma(1)=y).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PC}(W_n)\\coloneqq\\{A\\subseteq W_n:A\\ne\\varnothing\\land\\operatorname{PathConn}(A)\\land\\forall B\\subseteq W_n\\;((A\\subseteq B\\land\\operatorname{PathConn}(B))\\Rightarrow B=A)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PC}(W_n)\\coloneqq\\{A\\subseteq W_n:A\\ne\\varnothing\\land\\operatorname{PathConn}(A)\\land\\forall B\\subseteq W_n\\;((A\\subseteq B\\land\\operatorname{PathConn}(B))\\Rightarrow B=A)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"W_\\sigma\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\mathbb R^n:x_{\\sigma(1)}&lt;\\cdots&lt;x_{\\sigma(n)}\\}\\quad(\\sigma\\in S_n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[W_\\sigma\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\mathbb R^n:x_{\\sigma(1)}&lt;\\cdots&lt;x_{\\sigma(n)}\\}\\quad(\\sigma\\in S_n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PC}(W_n)=\\{W_\\sigma:\\sigma\\in S_n\\},\\qquad|\\operatorname{PC}(W_n)|=n!.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PC}(W_n)=\\{W_\\sigma:\\sigma\\in S_n\\},\\qquad|\\operatorname{PC}(W_n)|=n!.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>每个Wσ由严格线性不等式定义，是非空凸集，因而路径连通；所有不同坐标元组恰属于一个Wσ。不同排序之间有一对坐标的大小次序相反，沿任意连续路径其差必须过零，无法留在W_n内。因此各Wσ恰是极大路径分量。本条由教材≥n!加强到等号，附足完整本地证明，不额外授予拓扑复杂度下界的证明资格。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 16.20 and proof；印刷页 328–329；PDF 页 354–355。来源为本任务提供的605页本地PDF。</p>\n<p>R5新建理由：补足第16章的 Order Chambers of Element Distinctness，查重范围为本书目录的全部既有原子文件名、MOC及相邻相关定义全文；未读取其他书籍原子，全部声明依赖留在28目录。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"W_n=\\{x\\in\\mathbb R^n:\\forall i\\ne j\\ x_i\\ne x_j\\}","display":false},{"tex":"S_n","display":false},{"tex":"[n]","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\|\\cdot\\|_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Path}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PathConn}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PC}(W_n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Path}(A)\\coloneqq\\{\\gamma:[0,1]\\to A:\\forall t\\in[0,1]\\;\\forall\\epsilon>0\\;\\exists\\delta>0\\;\\forall s\\in[0,1]\\;(|s-t|<\\delta\\Rightarrow\\|\\gamma(s)-\\gamma(t)\\|_2<\\epsilon)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PathConn}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall x,y\\in A\\;\\exists\\gamma\\in\\operatorname{Path}(A)\\;(\\gamma(0)=x\\land\\gamma(1)=y).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PC}(W_n)\\coloneqq\\{A\\subseteq W_n:A\\ne\\varnothing\\land\\operatorname{PathConn}(A)\\land\\forall B\\subseteq W_n\\;((A\\subseteq B\\land\\operatorname{PathConn}(B))\\Rightarrow B=A)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"W_\\sigma\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\mathbb R^n:x_{\\sigma(1)}<\\cdots<x_{\\sigma(n)}\\}\\quad(\\sigma\\in S_n).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PC}(W_n)=\\{W_\\sigma:\\sigma\\in S_n\\},\\qquad|\\operatorname{PC}(W_n)|=n!.","display":true}],"bytes":2522,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-359","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-arithmetic-straight-line-program]]、[[28-lem-straight-line-degree-bound]]、[[28-df-arithmetic-formula]]、[[28-df-polynomial-projection]]、[[28-df-algebraic-computation-tree]]、[[28-thm-element-distinctness-components]]、[[28-df-bss-machine]]、[[28-df-complex-bss-p-np]]。"}],"outgoing":[]}